Bootstrapping dependencies
--------------------------

Run `scripts/bootstrap_deps.sh` to install the compiler toolchain and third-party libraries on a supported platform (Ubuntu/Debian, Fedora, Arch, or macOS with Homebrew).
The script requires sudo access when installing system packages.

On macOS the script writes a `.env` file that pre-populates `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` with the Homebrew Qt5 location. Source this file before configuring a build, or export the variable manually if you prefer to manage environment setup yourself.


Forge has the following dependencies:

Windows note: Place deps in windows_deps directory in the repo root
so that the CMake find_library command can find them. Please see
src/Forge/CMakeLists.txt and src/Forge/Graphics/Text/CMakeLists.txt
for library search paths.

